+<p>This package is a collection of GICP-based fast point cloud registration algorithms. It constains a multi-threaded GICP algorithm as well as multi-thread and GPU implementations of our voxelized GICP. </p>
+<ul>
+<li>FastGICP (~20FPS): multi-threaded Generalized ICP algorithm</li>
+<li>FastGICPSingleThread (~10FPS): GICP algorithm optimized for single-threading</li>
+<li>FastVGICP (~30FPS): multi-threaded and voxelized GICP algorithm</li>
+<li>FastVGICPCuda (~120FPS): CUDA-optimized voxelized GICP algorithm</li>
